  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-upgrade-an-element step 5 adds what looks like an Element (in the sense of IDL type) to the stack.\r\n\r\nBut https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#htmlconstructorstep 11 seems to think the stack contains ES objects.\r\n\r\nThere's actually some similar confusion in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#htmlconstructor step 8, where we first create an IDL Element and then start doing ES things with it immediately...",
